  "prototypeNotes": [
    "This index is the canonical discovery surface for Character creation fixtures.",
    "Fixtures are test artifacts and never become runtime Character authority.",
    "Partial fixtures remain disabled until their candidate content identities resolve against reviewed catalogs.",
    "Base fixtures reduce duplication but all patch application remains deterministic and explicit.",
    "The indexed suite covers the supported prototype slice while preserving known coverage gaps.",
    "Chronicle owns fixture loading, test isolation, generated identities, persistence setup, diagnostics, and fingerprints.",
    "The Rule Set package owns fixture semantics, expected mechanical outcomes, invalidations, and repair expectations."
